WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.500
Without shared context, each Agent must rediscover
decisions the team has already settled.

00:08.500 --> 00:20.000
Task-scoped reads supply relevant, authorized context—
not the entire Tree.

00:20.000 --> 00:31.000
Settled constraints guide design, code, and tests
without replacing verification.

00:31.000 --> 00:46.000
Temporary detail stays with the code; review protects
shared context before a lasting decision enters the Tree.

00:46.000 --> 00:55.000
After approval, the shared snapshot becomes
the next loop's starting point.
